{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">無綫節目《阿爺廚房》中，李家鼎（鼎爺）曾親自出馬，為大家炮製順德名菜「五柳蒸鯇魚」。這道菜式極之講究精準火候，蒸煮出來的鯇魚腩肉質能保留極致的嫩滑與鮮甜；最後再淋上慢火熬製的五柳芡汁，酸甜開胃的醬汁與魚肉鮮香完美交融，口感層次豐富，絕對是一道惹味又下飯的必學佳餚！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3f7006cf-dc32-4ce0-a65a-97915796bf2a.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026Yuiq98jyBl1784025271.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3f7006cf-dc32-4ce0-a65a-97915796bf2a.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>五柳蒸鯇魚所需材料</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>主料：</strong> 鯇魚腩、五柳</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>配料及調味料：</strong> 薑絲、鹽、糖</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; t